Package: ocrinfer
Type: Package
Title: Statistical Evaluation of OCR and Handwritten Text Recognition
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: person(
    given = "Florian",
    family = "Cafiero",
    role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "florian.cafiero@epita.fr"
  )
Description: Tools for reproducible statistical evaluation of optical character
    recognition (OCR) and handwritten text recognition (HTR) outputs. The
    package provides Unicode-aware normalization, grapheme-, codepoint-, and
    word-level alignment, character and word error rates, micro and macro
    aggregation, paired cluster-bootstrap system comparisons, normalization
    sensitivity analysis, and error diagnostics.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/floriancafiero/packagehtrocr
BugReports: https://github.com/floriancafiero/packagehtrocr/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
